sequenceDiagram
autonumber

actor User
participant Frontend as Frontend\nReact + Vite
participant Api as API Layer\nKoa Routes + Auth/RBAC
participant Services as Service Layer\nGenTask / File / Support / Triage / Analytics
participant Worker as Processing Modules\nQueue Worker + Node RAG Pipeline
participant Redis as External Services\nRedis + Bull + SSE
participant External as External Services\nGraph / Solr / Python RAG / LLM / FAQ / File Storage
participant Postgres as Database\nPostgreSQL

note over Frontend,Postgres: The frontend calls the Koa API. The API authenticates the caller, routes requests, and delegates business operations to services. Long-running chat and file-processing work is executed by the worker through Redis and Bull. PostgreSQL is the system of record for users, tasks, files, history, notifications, analytics, triage, and audit data.

User->>Frontend: Open app and submit login
Frontend->>Api: POST /api/auth/login or /api/auth/sso/microsoft
activate Api
alt Employee ID login
  Api->>Services: Validate credentials and resolve access scope
  activate Services
  Services->>Postgres: SELECT user, role, department, status
  activate Postgres
  Postgres-->>Services: User record + permissions
  deactivate Postgres
  Services->>Redis: Store session state in Redis
  activate Redis
  Redis-->>Services: Session created
  deactivate Redis
  Services-->>Api: JWT + access scope
  deactivate Services
else Microsoft SSO login
  Api->>Services: Validate SSO token and map user
  activate Services
  Services->>External: GET Microsoft Graph profile
  activate External
  External-->>Services: Email + displayName + principalId
  deactivate External
  Services->>Postgres: UPSERT user + role mapping
  activate Postgres
  Postgres-->>Services: User record + permissions
  deactivate Postgres
  Services->>Redis: Store session state in Redis
  activate Redis
  Redis-->>Services: Session created
  deactivate Redis
  Services-->>Api: JWT + access scope
  deactivate Services
end
Api-->>Frontend: Authentication response
deactivate Api
Frontend-->>User: Render permitted features

loop Each authenticated user action
  User->>Frontend: Trigger application feature

  alt Chat and RAG workflow
    Frontend->>Api: POST /api/gen-task with prompt payload
    activate Api
    Api->>Services: Validate request and create CHAT task
    activate Services
    Services->>Postgres: INSERT task row + output row
    activate Postgres
    Postgres-->>Services: taskId + outputId
    deactivate Postgres
    Services->>Redis: Enqueue Bull chat job with task metadata
    activate Redis
    Redis-->>Services: Job queued
    deactivate Redis
    Services-->>Api: Accepted task metadata
    deactivate Services
    Api-->>Frontend: 202 Accepted with taskId
    deactivate Api

    Redis->>Worker: Deliver chat job
    activate Worker
    Worker->>Postgres: SELECT task context, prior turns, scope, file filters
    activate Postgres
    Postgres-->>Worker: Persisted task metadata + history
    deactivate Postgres

    alt Prompt blocked by moderation
      Worker->>Postgres: UPDATE output, history, analytics, notifications
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Worker: Moderation result persisted
      deactivate Postgres
      Worker->>Redis: Publish final blocked response
      activate Redis
      Redis-->>Worker: Live event published
      deactivate Redis
    else Prompt can be processed
      Worker->>Worker: Classify intent, resolve language, build retrieval plan
      alt Company policy or enterprise knowledge query
        Worker->>External: Search Solr and optional Python RAG backend
        activate External
        External-->>Worker: Ranked evidence, semantic candidates, chunks
        deactivate External
        Worker->>External: Generate grounded answer via LLM
        activate External
        External-->>Worker: Answer, title, translation fixups
        deactivate External
      else FAQ lookup
        Worker->>External: Query FAQ cache
        activate External
        External-->>Worker: FAQ hit or miss
        deactivate External
        opt FAQ miss fallback
          Worker->>External: Direct LLM completion
          activate External
          External-->>Worker: Generated answer
          deactivate External
        end
      else General chat or translation request
        Worker->>External: Direct LLM completion or translation
        activate External
        External-->>Worker: Generated answer
        deactivate External
      end

      Worker->>Postgres: UPDATE output, title, history, notifications, analytics
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Worker: Final response persisted
      deactivate Postgres
      Worker->>Redis: Publish status, chunk, and done events
      activate Redis
      Redis-->>Worker: Live events available
      deactivate Redis
    end
    deactivate Worker

    loop Until chat output reaches terminal status
      Frontend->>Api: GET /api/gen-task-output/stream or /api/gen-task-output/list
      activate Api
      Api->>Services: Read live state for task output
      activate Services
      Services->>Redis: Read SSE or live channel state if available
      activate Redis
      Redis-->>Services: Latest live event or empty result
      deactivate Redis
      Services->>Postgres: SELECT latest output snapshot
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Status + partial or final content
      deactivate Postgres
      Services-->>Api: Response payload for frontend
      deactivate Services
      Api-->>Frontend: Chunk, status, or final answer
      deactivate Api
    end

    opt User sends feedback or on-demand translation
      Frontend->>Api: POST /api/gen-task/feedback or /api/gen-task/translate-on-demand
      activate Api
      Api->>Services: Record feedback or translate output
      activate Services
      alt Feedback path
        Services->>Postgres: INSERT analytics feedback event
        activate Postgres
        Postgres-->>Services: Feedback stored
        deactivate Postgres
        Services->>External: Send FAQ feedback signal
        activate External
        External-->>Services: Cache feedback result
        deactivate External
      else Translation path
        Services->>Postgres: SELECT saved output content
        activate Postgres
        Postgres-->>Services: Output text + language metadata
        deactivate Postgres
        Services->>External: Translate via LLM
        activate External
        External-->>Services: Translated text
        deactivate External
      end
      Services-->>Api: Feature response
      deactivate Services
      Api-->>Frontend: Updated answer or feedback status
      deactivate Api
    end

    Frontend-->>User: Display answer, citations, and status

  else Document workflow
    Frontend->>Api: Upload, list, preview, download, or delete document
    activate Api
    Api->>Services: Execute file operation
    activate Services
    alt Upload files
      Services->>External: Write files to upload storage
      activate External
      External-->>Services: Storage key + physical path
      deactivate External
      Services->>Postgres: INSERT file metadata + document metadata
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Persisted file ids
      deactivate Postgres
      Services->>External: Index in Solr and optional Python RAG ingestion
      activate External
      External-->>Services: Indexing result
      deactivate External
      Services-->>Api: Upload response
    else List, preview, or download
      Services->>Postgres: SELECT authorized file records
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Filtered file rows
      deactivate Postgres
      Services->>External: Read preview or binary stream from file storage
      activate External
      External-->>Services: Preview content or file stream
      deactivate External
      Services-->>Api: File list or stream response
    else Delete document
      Services->>Postgres: SELECT file metadata and verify scope
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: File key + ownership data
      deactivate Postgres
      Services->>External: Delete from Solr, Python RAG, and file storage
      activate External
      External-->>Services: Deletion confirmations
      deactivate External
      Services->>Postgres: DELETE file metadata row
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Deletion committed
      deactivate Postgres
      Services-->>Api: Delete response
    end
    Api-->>Frontend: File operation response
    deactivate Services
    deactivate Api
    Frontend-->>User: Update document screen

  else Support, history, notifications, analytics, and triage workflow
    Frontend->>Api: Request support, inbox, history, analytics, or triage action
    activate Api
    Api->>Services: Execute business operation
    activate Services
    alt Read history, notifications, or analytics
      Services->>Postgres: SELECT paged history, notifications, metrics, or activity
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Datasets + aggregates
      deactivate Postgres
      Services-->>Api: Response payload
    else Create support ticket or direct message
      Services->>Postgres: INSERT support ticket or message row
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Created id + status
      deactivate Postgres
      Services-->>Api: Success response
    else Admin reply or broadcast
      Services->>Postgres: UPDATE support ticket or INSERT admin message + notification
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Persisted reply or broadcast
      deactivate Postgres
      Services-->>Api: Response payload
    else Create or update triage ticket
      Services->>Postgres: Check duplicates and load routing context
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Duplicate state + prior context
      deactivate Postgres
      alt Auto-route escalation
        Services->>External: Classify department, urgency, and sentiment via LLM
        activate External
        External-->>Services: Routing analysis
        deactivate External
      end
      Services->>Postgres: INSERT or UPDATE triage ticket, payload, audit log, and notifications
      activate Postgres
      Postgres-->>Services: Ticket state persisted
      deactivate Postgres
      Services-->>Api: Triage response
    end
    Api-->>Frontend: JSON response
    deactivate Services
    deactivate Api
    Frontend-->>User: Update current screen
  end
end

note over Services,Worker: Recurring jobs can enqueue file upload work through Redis and Bull, and the worker reuses the same indexing path. Aviary-compatible routes reuse the same authentication, task, and audit service flows.
